WEBVTT

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.600
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.740
Check it!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.580
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.940
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.810
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.480
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.380
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.560
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.260
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:53.600
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.100
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.400
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.440
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.970
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.780
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.410
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:11.510
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.020
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:18.520
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.930
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.050
Fly up, angel

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.330
Wait! You can't beat that with a sword!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.300
That's not a demon!

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.130
It's a cybot!

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:11.010
Hey! You alright?!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.490
Damn!

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:50.910
Here it comes!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.540
No surprise there...

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.940
Hey! Where you going?!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.510
Hey!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.170
Now you've done it!

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.810
Damn it!

00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:02.770
<i>I can't keep this up! I need
to lure out the person inside...!</i>

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:42.720
That get 'im?!

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.330
Now you die!

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:37.240
What the hell was that...?

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:40.300
I'm sure I sensed her...

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.440
The enemy...

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.680
Hey...

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.870
The village burned down...

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.620
There's no reason to kill
the demon monster anymore...

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.460
Still wanna fight it, huh?

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.600
As strong as your sword is,
he's a chunk of steel!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.640
You're no match for him!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.500
Leave this place! You don't
have to die pointlessly!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.480
You listening to me?!

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:52.390
<i>What am I saying? Why am
I worried about this guy?</i>

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:54.050
<i>I must be crazy</i>.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:08.440
The graves of the guys
you fought beside?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:31.150
<i>Is he resigned to die here?</i>

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.180
Your last weapon?

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:06.730
Guess it's my destiny
to put my faith in this...

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.530
No, not necessarily...

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:23.010
If what I've been sensing
are her thought waves...

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:27.150
...then we might be connected somehow.

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:31.920
In which case, I should be able
to send my own thought waves.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:35.150
I might be able to call it here!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:45.370
<i>Come, you lousy ghost! Come here...!</i>

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.560
<i>I'm right here!</i>

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:03.380
<i>Come. Don't you want to kill me?
Come on out...!</i>

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:07.380
<i>I won't run or hide! Come out...!</i>

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.640
It came...!

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.380
You the pilot?

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:46.220
My name is Maria. I've come for you.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:05.880
You're here for me? Cut the crap!

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:10.050
That's what the boss told me.
OUR boss...

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:16.460
Boss? And who's that?
And what do you mean by "our"?!

00:11:16.460 --> 00:11:20.560
..I guess you really don't remember.
..What does that mean?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:23.730
I knew you had lost your memory.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:29.470
After all, we've been programmed
to be capable of checking each other.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.140
Programmed?

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:34.980
But that's not the issue here.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:40.040
It seems we stumbled into
an odd world while fighting...

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:27.930
I have a good idea why.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:32.870
Our extraordinarily-developed
combat abilities went over their limits

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:36.500
and some sort of resultant
energy opened a gateway.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:38.870
That's the only thing I can think of.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.910
Hold on! Are you saying this is..

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:46.750
There's no positive proof,
but this is not the real world we know.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:51.150
A void of nothingness; an abyss
between reality and unreality...

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:57.590
I'll ask one more time.
Who are you? What is your goal?

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:02.760
We've been modified so that
we won't fight each other.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:08.200
Regardless, you avoided
capture and fought back at me.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.440
You're beyond repair.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:14.940
..What the hell are you..
..At this rate, you will die.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:18.210
Me?! Quit screwing around!

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:19.810
I'm not.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:24.290
Your lack of memory is proof
that your program is malfunctioning.

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:29.660
In that state, your life functions
cannot avoid being affected.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.290
Eventually you will break down...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.760
...and die.

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:51.550
It's true that I'm bad
at remembering things...

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:56.250
But I haven't forgotten
that you messed up old Leo!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.020
I don't wish to fight you.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:03.060
The boss hasn't given me
orders to kill you yet anyway.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:07.190
I wish to. And I always will!

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:11.900
Come with me and you're
on my side. Otherwise...

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:17.170
In battle...
that's more than enough reason!

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.520
Bastard!

00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.660
Damn! Don't screw with me!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:44.060
Think you've made fun of me?!

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:06.520
I'll drag you out of there!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.150
With these!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:14.860
Damn it! Now what?!

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:45.990
Jo, do you read me?! This is Sei!

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:50.460
Respond, Jo! Who's the enemy?!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.000
She can't hear anything you say!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:57.560
Seems she's fighting in a
completely out-of-control state!

00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:14.320
It doesn't matter who you are anymore!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:18.660
All that matters now is
who'll bite the dust first!

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:07.970
What the...?!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:10.000
Show your face already...

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:23.810
Stop!

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:25.850
What...?!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:43.800
Why did you try to kill me?!
What is your goal?!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:54.420
I don't want to fight you, either.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:57.210
It looks like you made a mistake...

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.920
Of all the times...

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:21.340
You're not gonna eat?

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.800
What an old village. You alone here?

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:29.910
What happened to everyone else?

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:36.420
You were hired to kill the monster?

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:42.860
So you remain here to get revenge?!

00:21:27.630 --> 00:21:30.000
Jo! Are you all right?!

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:32.540
Respond!

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.030
Jo!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:37.340
Yeah...

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:39.440
I'm alive...

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:04.220
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:11.860
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:19.560
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:28.940
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:35.480
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:44.490
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:51.360
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:15.990
<i>The holy land of corruption</i>.
<i>A castle of violence</i>.

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:20.930
<i>The harsh rule of survival-of-the-fittest
swallows both dreams and hope</i>.

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:25.660
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Immortal Classmate"
